**E (Scheduling)** - Fixed the hook length formula bug. Subtree sizes must be computed from the forest of **fixed edges only** (ignoring flexible edges), with each tree rooted at its sink (node with outdeg=0). Verified: example gives 10, random test gives 840 matching brute force.

